<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-SOUTH AFRICAN SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AFRICAN SUPERSPORT SERIES CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>first day of four-day Supersport series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>In Pretoria: Natal 359-9 (Errol Stewart 78, Neil Johnson 69)</p>
<p>v Northern Transvaal.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal 206-5 (Neil McKenzie 80, Adam</p>
<p>Bacher 58) v Boland.</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Western Province 235-4 (Jacques Kallis 118</p>
<p>not out, Sven Koenig 52) v Free State.</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Eastern Province 401-4 (Louis Koen 186,</p>
<p>Mark Rushmere 63, Dave Callaghan 61 not out) v Griqualand West.</p>
</text>
